Arara Code: quick input (Quick Open, history, transfer pickers) opens centered by default.

- quickInputController.ts: with no saved position, start at the same spot as
  'Align Quick Input Center' (25% from the top, centered) and mark the
  'Center' option in the layout menu. Choosing 'Top' (or double-clicking the
  title bar) is stored, so it sticks.

Why a patch: the quick input position is only stored in application storage;
there is no setting or product.json key for its default.
Touches: src/vs/platform/quickinput/browser/quickInputController.ts

--- a/src/vs/platform/quickinput/browser/quickInputController.ts
+++ b/src/vs/platform/quickinput/browser/quickInputController.ts
